      Nathan<br>
      <span class="accent">Mueller</span>
    </h1>

    <!-- SCOREBOARD TICKER -->
    <div class="scoreboard" aria-label="rotating stats">
      <span class="scoreboard-label">LIVE FEED</span>
      <div class="scoreboard-ticker">
        <div class="ticker-track" id="ticker">
          <span class="ticker-item">Turning raw data into actionable insights</span>
          <span class="ticker-item">Quantifying luck in NHL standings since 2024</span>
          <span class="ticker-item">5 tools: Excel · R · Python · SQL · Tableau</span>
          <span class="ticker-item">Finding the signal buried in the noise</span>
          <span class="ticker-item">Sports + Statistics = Competitive edge</span>
        </div>
      </div>
