      in plain sight, the luck masquerading as skill.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-primary">View Projects</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/natem31" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-ghost">GitHub ↗</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nate-mueller-b10552279/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-ghost">LinkedIn ↗</a>
