      <p class="project-desc">
        Explores how much of a team's standing position is earned versus lucky. Using
        Expected Goals (xG) data, I built an aggregate Luck Index that surfaces the gap
        between a team's actual points and what their underlying play deserved — separating
        genuine performance from variance.
      </p>

      <!-- Mini visualization -->
      <div class="luck-viz">
        <p class="luck-viz-title">Sample Luck Index — 2023–24 Season Snapshot</p>
        <div class="luck-bars" id="luckBars">
          <div class="luck-row">
            <span class="luck-team">FLA</span>
            <div class="luck-track"><div class="luck-fill" style="width:0%" data-w="78%" data-color="#C8102E"></div></div>
            <span class="luck-val" style="color:#C8102E">+8.2</span>
          </div>
          <div class="luck-row">
            <span class="luck-team">BOS</span>
            <div class="luck-track"><div class="luck-fill" style="width:0%" data-w="62%" data-color="#C8102E"></div></div>
            <span class="luck-val" style="color:#C8102E">+5.1</span>
          </div>
          <div class="luck-row">
            <span class="luck-team">NYR</span>
            <div class="luck-track"><div class="luck-fill" style="width:0%" data-w="52%" data-color="#4A90C4"></div></div>
            <span class="luck-val" style="color:#4A90C4">+1.7</span>
          </div>
          <div class="luck-row">
            <span class="luck-team">CGY</span>
            <div class="luck-track"><div class="luck-fill" style="width:0%" data-w="40%" data-color="#4A90C4"></div></div>
            <span class="luck-val" style="color:#4A90C4">−2.3</span>
          </div>
          <div class="luck-row">
            <span class="luck-team">CHI</span>
            <div class="luck-track"><div class="luck-fill" style="width:0%" data-w="22%" data-color="#7A90A8"></div></div>
            <span class="luck-val" style="color:#7A90A8">−7.9</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="luck-note">Illustrative — see the full analysis on GitHub ↗</p>
      </div>

      <div class="project-tags">
        <span class="project-tag">R</span>
        <span class="project-tag">Expected Goals</span>
        <span class="project-tag">NHL</span>
        <span class="project-tag">Statistical Modeling</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PLACEHOLDER CARD -->
    <div class="project-add reveal">
